WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en
Style:
::cue(c.colorCCCCCC) { color: rgb(204,204,204);
 }
::cue(c.colorEEEEEE) { color: rgb(238,238,238);
 }
::cue(c.cyan) { color: cyan; }
::cue(c.green) { color: green; }
::cue(c.yellow) { color: yellow; }
##

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:03.580 line:91%
Back in 2015,
I hated the idea of doing

00:00:03.580 --> 00:00:05.720 line:91%
any sort of stuff
that involved G-forces.

00:00:05.720 --> 00:00:07.420 line:85%
It absolutely terrified me.

00:00:07.420 --> 00:00:09.990 line:91%
You can see that the very
first time that I did

00:00:09.990 --> 00:00:10.980 line:85%
a loop in a glider.

00:00:10.980 --> 00:00:12.100 line:85%
Oh boy!

00:00:12.100 --> 00:00:14.083 line:91%
Oh boy, oh boy,
oh boy, oh boy!

00:00:14.083 --> 00:00:16.510 line:91%
Don't freak out, don't
freak out, don't freak out.

00:00:16.510 --> 00:00:18.210 line:85%
I was freaked out the whole time,

00:00:18.210 --> 00:00:20.460 position:59% line:85%
but since then I've done so much stuff

00:00:20.460 --> 00:00:23.808 line:91%
in so many wonderful things
that I've learned to love it.

00:00:23.808 --> 00:00:25.650 line:85%
And I want to do it again.

00:00:25.650 --> 00:00:28.460 line:85%
So I figured, I'd invite a friend.

00:00:28.460 --> 00:00:30.126 align:start size:88% position:13% line:85%
<c.cyan>Hello.</c>

00:00:29.293 --> 00:00:30.126 line:85%
Hello.

00:00:30.126 --> 00:00:31.190 line:85%
That was natural, wasn't it?

00:00:31.190 --> 00:00:35.150 position:56% line:91%
<c.cyan>I was waiting poised just off camera
to walk perfectly-on-cue in.</c>

00:00:35.150 --> 00:00:35.983 line:85%
Yup.

00:00:35.983 --> 00:00:38.943 position:63% line:91%
No, it's... this is the first video that
we're filming for this channel.

00:00:38.943 --> 00:00:40.130 line:85%
We have no idea...

00:00:40.130 --> 00:00:42.510 line:91%
Like we've got a camera op,
we've got a producer.

00:00:42.510 --> 00:00:44.610 position:66% line:85%
I have no idea what's going to happen now.

00:00:44.610 --> 00:00:45.443 line:85%
<c.cyan>Well, neither do I.</c>

00:00:45.443 --> 00:00:46.780 line:85%
<c.cyan>I got a text from you a while back,</c>

00:00:46.780 --> 00:00:50.010 line:91%
<c.cyan>and you said, "How do you
feel about aerobatics?"</c>

00:00:50.010 --> 00:00:51.540 line:85%
<c.cyan>And I had no idea what you meant.</c>

00:00:51.540 --> 00:00:53.220 line:91%
<c.cyan>I didn't know you were
inviting me to do a video.</c>

00:00:53.220 --> 00:00:54.870 position:63% line:85%
<c.cyan>I just thought you're asking my opinion.</c>

00:00:54.870 --> 00:00:56.210 line:85%
<c.cyan>So I said, "Yeah, sounds fun."</c>

00:00:56.210 --> 00:00:57.970 line:91%
<c.cyan>And then you said, "Okay,
great, we'll do a video."</c>

00:00:57.970 --> 00:01:00.760 line:91%
<c.cyan>And I also decided not to
Google what aerobatics is,</c>

00:01:00.760 --> 00:01:02.997 line:91%
<c.cyan>because I imagine whatever
you have planned for today,</c>

00:01:02.997 --> 00:01:04.970 line:85%
<c.cyan>it's bound to have safety harnesses</c>

00:01:04.970 --> 00:01:06.240 line:85%
<c.cyan>coming out of my ear holes.</c>

00:01:06.240 --> 00:01:07.940 line:85%
<c.cyan>How dangerous could it be?</c>

00:01:07.940 --> 00:01:09.720 line:91%
First things first,
I'm not flying you.

00:01:09.720 --> 00:01:10.730 line:85%
<c.cyan>Oh good.</c>

00:01:10.730 --> 00:01:13.699 position:59% line:85%
This is the British Aerobatic Academy.

00:01:13.699 --> 00:01:18.560 line:91%
So these are the pilots who
teach pilots to do aerobatics.

00:01:18.560 --> 00:01:22.700 position:58% line:91%
<c.cyan>By which you mean we are in arguably
the safest possible place we could be</c>

00:01:22.700 --> 00:01:24.320 line:85%
<c.cyan>for being flown in a tiny plane.</c>

00:01:24.320 --> 00:01:25.360 line:85%
I'm not qualified to fly this.

00:01:25.360 --> 00:01:27.580 position:61% line:91%
I'm frankly not qualified to go near it
without someone else around.

00:01:27.580 --> 00:01:32.580 line:91%
So, also here, standing awkwardly
out of the camera shot...

00:01:32.898 --> 00:01:34.710 line:85%
Introduce yourself, please.

00:01:34.710 --> 00:01:37.330 line:91%
<c.green>I'm Joe. Welcome to the
British Aerobatics Academy.</c>

00:01:37.330 --> 00:01:40.220 line:91%
<c.green>The two planes we're going to
be flying today, both Extras.</c>

00:01:40.220 --> 00:01:41.780 line:85%
<c.green>This is the Extra 300.</c>

00:01:41.780 --> 00:01:44.338 position:58% line:85%
<c.green>And out there we've got an Extra 200.</c>

00:01:44.338 --> 00:01:47.488 line:91%
<c.green>The only difference is this
one is slightly bigger.</c>

00:01:47.488 --> 00:01:50.666 line:91%
<c.green>And the thing in the
front that pulls you along</c>

00:01:50.666 --> 00:01:52.657 line:85%
<c.green>has got a hundred more horsepower.</c>

00:01:52.657 --> 00:01:53.720 line:85%
Right, okay.

00:01:53.720 --> 00:01:55.210 line:91%
<c.cyan>The guy in charge of
our safety called it</c>

00:01:55.210 --> 00:01:57.493 line:91%
<c.cyan>"the thing in the front
that pulls you along"!</c>

00:01:57.493 --> 00:02:00.669 position:58% line:85%
<c.green>They both are very capable and can do</c>

00:02:00.669 --> 00:02:05.150 line:91%
<c.green>every aerobatic manoeuvre that
you would ever dream about</c>

00:02:05.150 --> 00:02:06.830 line:85%
<c.green>and probably not dream about.</c>

00:02:06.830 --> 00:02:08.720 line:91%
<c.cyan>I'm nervously looking
around for one of those signs</c>

00:02:08.720 --> 00:02:10.939 line:91%
<c.cyan>that says "X number of
days without an accident".</c>

00:02:10.939 --> 00:02:12.928 line:85%
<c.colorCCCCCC><i>(all laugh)</i></c>

00:02:12.928 --> 00:02:14.280 position:61% line:85%
<c.green>Do you want me to show you guys around?</c>

00:02:14.280 --> 00:02:15.946 line:91%
<c.cyan>Yeah.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>Yes, please! Let's see the plane.</c>

00:02:15.946 --> 00:02:17.840 position:56% line:85%
<c.cyan>My wife has insisted that I text her</c>

00:02:17.840 --> 00:02:20.260 line:91%
<c.cyan>the minute we land, because
she's really worried.</c>

00:02:20.260 --> 00:02:22.340 line:91%
I feel like she's more worried
than you at this point?

00:02:22.340 --> 00:02:24.330 line:85%
<c.cyan>Right, it's either that I have</c>

00:02:24.330 --> 00:02:26.859 line:91%
<c.cyan>perfect confidence in
Joe and in the system</c>

00:02:26.859 --> 00:02:29.116 position:61% line:85%
<c.cyan>or I'm just blocking it out of my mind.</c>

00:02:29.116 --> 00:02:31.760 line:91%
<c.green>So this is what you're
going to be sitting in.</c>

00:02:31.760 --> 00:02:33.974 position:59% line:85%
<c.green>As you can see, there's not much room.</c>

00:02:33.974 --> 00:02:37.800 line:91%
<c.green>You guys will be in the front, and
the instructor will be in the back.</c>

00:02:37.800 --> 00:02:40.570 position:64% line:85%
<c.green>The main thing for you guys in the front,</c>

00:02:40.570 --> 00:02:43.250 position:66% line:85%
<c.green>is probably that little paper thing there.</c>

00:02:43.250 --> 00:02:44.953 line:91%
Okay.
<c.cyan>Hang on.</c>

00:02:46.140 --> 00:02:47.700 line:85%
<c.cyan>Is it a sick bag?</c>

00:02:47.700 --> 00:02:48.650 line:85%
<c.green>It's a sick bag.</c>

00:02:48.650 --> 00:02:50.871 line:91%
Ah, okay.
Good, yes.

00:02:50.871 --> 00:02:53.523 line:85%
<c.green>It's got a five point harness.</c>

00:02:53.523 --> 00:02:55.900 line:85%
<c.green>So any negative or positive G,</c>

00:02:55.900 --> 00:02:58.100 position:56% line:85%
<c.green>you shouldn't move out of your seat.</c>

00:02:58.100 --> 00:02:59.780 line:85%
<c.green>"Shouldn't" being the keyword.</c>

00:02:59.780 --> 00:03:02.016 line:91%
<c.cyan>What happens if we get
bored and want to leave?</c>

00:03:02.016 --> 00:03:03.930 line:85%
<i>(laughs)</i>

00:03:03.930 --> 00:03:05.883 position:59% line:85%
<c.green>Well, we don't have a parachute, so...</c>

00:03:07.177 --> 00:03:09.474 line:85%
<c.green>if you want to leave...</c>

00:03:09.474 --> 00:03:11.895 line:91%
<c.green>you're not going to go
home to your wife.</c>

00:03:11.895 --> 00:03:13.443 line:85%
Ooh!

00:03:13.443 --> 00:03:16.892 line:91%
That was more bleak than I
thought it was going to be.

00:03:16.892 --> 00:03:20.350 position:61% line:91%
<c.cyan>Am I imagining that this thing is
literally held together with duct tape?</c>

00:03:20.350 --> 00:03:21.183 line:85%
<c.green>Yes.</c>

00:03:21.183 --> 00:03:22.420 line:85%
<c.cyan>"Yes, I'm imagining it"?</c>

00:03:22.420 --> 00:03:25.462 line:91%
<c.green>That is not a critical
part of the aeroplane.</c>

00:03:25.462 --> 00:03:29.540 line:91%
<c.green>That is more just for
people in competitions</c>

00:03:29.540 --> 00:03:33.430 line:91%
<c.green>and to get the plane
going dead straight up.</c>

00:03:33.430 --> 00:03:34.960 line:85%
I like this casual mention,

00:03:34.960 --> 00:03:37.150 line:91%
"Yeah, when you're flying
vertically up, that's..."

00:03:37.150 --> 00:03:39.623 line:91%
<c.cyan>He's telling us like
we've got to do the controls.</c>

00:03:40.960 --> 00:03:42.102 line:85%
<c.green>You have.</c>

00:03:42.102 --> 00:03:43.000 line:85%
<c.cyan>Really?</c>

00:03:43.000 --> 00:03:44.500 line:85%
<c.green>Yes, you'll get a chance to do it.</c>

00:03:44.500 --> 00:03:46.166 line:85%
<c.cyan>Ooh. I didn't know that.</c>

00:03:46.166 --> 00:03:46.999 line:85%
I didn't know that until just now.

00:03:46.999 --> 00:03:48.920 line:91%
<c.cyan>I thought I was just going
to be sat in the front,</c>

00:03:48.920 --> 00:03:50.993 line:91%
<c.cyan>enjoying the view, but you mean
I've got a job to do.</c>

00:03:50.993 --> 00:03:52.300 line:85%
<c.green>They'll give you a go, yeah.</c>

00:03:52.300 --> 00:03:53.133 line:85%
<c.cyan>Oh wow.</c>

00:03:53.133 --> 00:03:54.690 line:85%
<c.cyan>Could I endanger us?</c>

00:03:54.690 --> 00:03:55.523 line:85%
<c.green>No.</c>

00:03:57.300 --> 00:03:58.433 line:85%
Why do you ask these things?!

00:03:58.433 --> 00:04:01.260 line:91%
<c.cyan>So that I can hear the
reassuring, "No, of course not.</c>

00:04:01.260 --> 00:04:03.190 line:91%
<c.cyan>"We obviously don't let
people do that sort of thing."</c>

00:04:03.190 --> 00:04:06.117 line:91%
It's more the tone of your
voice was like, "oh, can I?!"

00:04:07.004 --> 00:04:08.664 line:85%
<c.green>Can I kill us both?</c>

00:04:08.664 --> 00:04:09.497 line:85%
<c.cyan>Please.</c>

00:04:09.497 --> 00:04:11.700 line:91%
<c.green>No, obviously you'll have
an instructor in the back,</c>

00:04:11.700 --> 00:04:12.960 position:64% line:85%
<c.green>so they'll be talking you through it all.</c>

00:04:12.960 --> 00:04:14.600 line:85%
<c.cyan>I was already like really excited</c>

00:04:14.600 --> 00:04:15.960 line:91%
<c.cyan>and now I'm really,
really, really excited.</c>

00:04:15.960 --> 00:04:19.067 line:91%
<c.cyan>I'm going to actually kind of
fly a plane and not injure us.</c>

00:04:19.067 --> 00:04:19.958 line:85%
There we go.

00:04:19.958 --> 00:04:21.270 line:91%
That's the important bit.
<c.green>That's the main bit.</c>

00:04:21.270 --> 00:04:22.700 line:91%
Honestly, coming here,
it's like, it's fine,

00:04:22.700 --> 00:04:24.330 line:91%
I've done this before,
Jay will be nervous.

00:04:24.330 --> 00:04:27.246 line:91%
And now it's kind of the
other way just with the...

00:04:27.246 --> 00:04:28.230 line:85%
<c.cyan>I'm excited.</c>

00:04:28.230 --> 00:04:30.293 position:64% line:85%
<c.cyan>I feel like a boy in an aeroplane hangar.</c>

00:04:31.481 --> 00:04:34.034 line:91%
<c.cyan>This still makes me feel
like a big, strong man.</c>

00:04:34.034 --> 00:04:38.429 position:66% line:91%
<c.cyan>Do you remember those clips of Geoff Capes
pulling a plane all by himself?</c>

00:04:38.429 --> 00:04:40.829 line:91%
That's a reference I
haven't heard in a while.

00:04:42.603 --> 00:04:44.570 line:85%
<c.cyan>Shall we leave it here then?</c>

00:04:44.570 --> 00:04:46.950 line:91%
<c.yellow>So the plan is that we're
going to depart from here,</c>

00:04:46.950 --> 00:04:49.360 line:91%
<c.yellow>we're going to experience a
little bit of formation flying</c>

00:04:49.360 --> 00:04:50.980 line:85%
<c.yellow>and how it is flying formation.</c>

00:04:50.980 --> 00:04:52.240 line:91%
<c.yellow>Tom, you have some
experience with that before.</c>

00:04:52.240 --> 00:04:53.080 line:85%
Little bit, yeah.

00:04:53.080 --> 00:04:56.240 line:91%
<c.yellow>So it's going to be a
bit of a new thing for Jay.</c>

00:04:56.240 --> 00:04:57.720 position:59% line:85%
<c.cyan>I have no experience with this at all.</c>

00:04:57.720 --> 00:04:59.030 line:85%
<c.cyan>See, Tom's got the advantage here</c>

00:04:59.030 --> 00:05:00.066 line:85%
<c.cyan>because you've done this before.</c>

00:05:00.066 --> 00:05:01.716 line:85%
Why do you think I invited you?!

00:05:02.584 --> 00:05:04.810 line:91%
<c.cyan>So you already know
what your limits are,</c>

00:05:04.810 --> 00:05:07.150 line:91%
<c.cyan>and you know what you
like and don't like in a plane.</c>

00:05:07.150 --> 00:05:09.350 line:91%
<c.cyan>I have no idea if I'm
going to love it and do,</c>

00:05:09.350 --> 00:05:12.000 line:91%
<c.cyan>17 more loops-the-loop
than you do</c>

00:05:12.000 --> 00:05:13.680 line:91%
<c.cyan>or if I'm going to feel
sick after two seconds.</c>

00:05:13.680 --> 00:05:18.258 line:91%
See, I think I'm okay with this
because I've done loops and rolls.

00:05:18.258 --> 00:05:20.980 line:91%
I've done a stall turn
and I've done a break,

00:05:20.980 --> 00:05:23.281 line:85%
but I've not gone beyond that.

00:05:23.281 --> 00:05:25.427 line:85%
And I don't know what my limit is.

00:05:25.427 --> 00:05:28.051 line:91%
So it's quite possible that
we're going to get up there

00:05:28.051 --> 00:05:30.119 line:91%
and we're going to get
to that and it's like no,

00:05:30.119 --> 00:05:31.194 line:85%
that's as far as I can go,

00:05:31.194 --> 00:05:32.620 line:85%
and you're going to blast past me.

00:05:32.620 --> 00:05:33.880 line:85%
I have no idea.

00:05:33.880 --> 00:05:37.120 line:91%
<c.yellow>So yeah, we'll go on the
trip of pursuing your limits.</c>

00:05:37.120 --> 00:05:39.260 line:85%
<c.yellow>So we'll try to find what they are.</c>

00:05:39.260 --> 00:05:42.500 line:91%
<c.yellow>We might try multiple rolls
or loops combined with rolls</c>

00:05:42.500 --> 00:05:44.562 position:56% line:85%
<c.yellow>or some spinning, inverted spinning,</c>

00:05:44.562 --> 00:05:46.210 line:85%
<c.yellow>or whatever you prefer.</c>

00:05:46.210 --> 00:05:48.820 line:91%
<c.cyan>Should I be filling out some
kind of will before I go up?</c>

00:05:48.820 --> 00:05:51.150 line:85%
<c.yellow>I hope you guys will enjoy it.</c>

00:05:51.150 --> 00:05:52.130 line:85%
<c.yellow>Any questions?</c>

00:05:52.130 --> 00:05:55.425 line:91%
<c.cyan>Yeah, is it at all possible
for me to endanger us?</c>

00:05:55.425 --> 00:05:56.900 line:85%
<c.yellow>Pardon?</c>

00:05:56.900 --> 00:05:59.030 line:91%
Can you phrase that
differently, Jay?!

00:05:59.030 --> 00:06:01.630 line:91%
That sounds like
you're asking permission!

00:06:01.630 --> 00:06:03.170 line:85%
<c.cyan>Can I <i>(bleep)</i> up?</c>

00:06:04.003 --> 00:06:05.800 line:85%
Step on the cushions.

00:06:05.800 --> 00:06:07.387 line:85%
So I'm standing on the cushions.

00:06:07.387 --> 00:06:08.220 line:85%
<c.yellow>Yep.</c>

00:06:09.220 --> 00:06:10.539 line:85%
<c.yellow>Stand on the cushions.</c>

00:06:10.539 --> 00:06:12.292 line:85%
On the cushions just here, yep.

00:06:12.292 --> 00:06:13.840 line:85%
I said "stand on the cushions"

00:06:13.840 --> 00:06:15.200 line:85%
and I didn't stand on the cushions.

00:06:15.200 --> 00:06:16.393 line:85%
<c.cyan>Never felt safer in my life.</c>

00:06:16.393 --> 00:06:17.363 line:85%
<c.yellow>Right, excellent.</c>

00:06:19.350 --> 00:06:21.660 line:85%
I do wonder how Jay's feeling,

00:06:21.660 --> 00:06:24.180 position:63% line:85%
because he's had this kind of "I'm fine,

00:06:24.180 --> 00:06:26.240 line:91%
"I'm all calm, nothing
can go wrong" demeanour.

00:06:26.240 --> 00:06:28.533 position:63% line:85%
And I wonder how he's feeling right now.

00:06:29.390 --> 00:06:30.223 line:85%
<c.cyan>Hey, Tom.</c>

00:06:30.223 --> 00:06:32.869 line:91%
<c.cyan>We can communicate from
plane to plane like this.</c>

00:06:32.869 --> 00:06:34.260 line:85%
How are you feeling?

00:06:34.260 --> 00:06:36.203 line:85%
<c.cyan>I'm still feeling kind of numb.</c>

00:06:36.203 --> 00:06:38.140 line:91%
<c.cyan>I'm sort of waiting for
the nerves to set in.</c>

00:06:38.140 --> 00:06:40.257 line:91%
<c.cyan>I reckon it'll happen
as soon as we take off.</c>

00:06:40.257 --> 00:06:42.604 line:85%
<c.yellow>Tom, ready to take off?</c>

00:06:42.604 --> 00:06:43.573 line:85%
Brilliant.

00:06:47.211 --> 00:06:48.790 line:85%
<c.cyan>♪ Da da da da da da ♪</c>

00:06:48.790 --> 00:06:50.598 line:85%
<c.cyan>♪ Da da da da dun dun ♪</c>

00:06:50.598 --> 00:06:52.226 line:64%
<c.cyan>♪ Da dum ba da dum dum ♪</c>

00:06:52.226 --> 00:06:55.258 line:85%
<c.cyan>♪ Da dum ba da dum dum ♪</c>

00:06:55.258 --> 00:06:57.040 line:85%
<c.colorCCCCCC><i>(Jay and pilot laugh)</i></c>

00:07:00.818 --> 00:07:02.342 line:85%
<i>(laughs)</i>

00:07:08.918 --> 00:07:11.446 line:85%
<i>(laughs)</i>

00:07:15.065 --> 00:07:15.898 line:85%
Oh, wow.

00:07:28.589 --> 00:07:30.839 line:85%
<i>(laughs)</i>

00:07:57.061 --> 00:07:59.561 line:85%
<c.cyan><i>(yelling)</i></c>

00:08:05.472 --> 00:08:06.896 line:85%
<i>(laughs)</i>

00:08:10.612 --> 00:08:12.779 line:85%
<c.cyan><i>(yelling)</i></c>

00:08:40.813 --> 00:08:41.646 line:85%
<c.cyan>Ooh!</c>

00:08:44.085 --> 00:08:47.752 line:85%
<c.yellow>And now's the complete shape.</c>

00:09:03.763 --> 00:09:05.413 line:85%
<c.yellow>That's Jay, over there.</c>

00:09:05.413 --> 00:09:06.488 line:85%
Yes!

00:09:24.240 --> 00:09:29.240 line:85%
<c.yellow><i>(indistinct radio chatter)</i></c>

